---
layout: base.njk
navKey: press
title: Press Kit
metaTitle: "Press Kit | Phi Gallery, Watertown NY"
description: "Press kit for Phi Gallery — boilerplate, fact sheet, coordinators, and media contact. A DIY community art space and live music venue in downtown Watertown, NY."
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Home
    url: /
  - label: Press
---
<section class="section wrap-narrow">
  <header class="stack" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);">
    <p class="kicker">For journalists &amp; partners</p>
    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: var(--fs-3xl);">Press Kit</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything you need to cover Phi Gallery. For hi-res originals or interviews, reach <a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a>.</p>
    <div class="cluster">
      {%- if settings.pressKitUrl %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ settings.pressKitUrl }}" rel="noopener" data-analytics="press-download">Download press kit (ZIP)</a>
      {%- else %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}?subject=Phi%20Gallery%20press%20assets" data-analytics="press-download">Request hi-res assets</a>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>One-liner</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a DIY community art space and live music venue on Public Square in downtown Watertown, NY.</p>

    <h2>Short boilerplate</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a community art space in the heart of downtown Watertown, NY. Opened in 2023 by Stow Dunham, the gallery hosts visual art exhibits, live music, literary arts workshops, sound healing, and a rotating collective of local artisanal vendors. Phi Gallery is coordinated by Stow Dunham, Dana Gillan, and Mykel "Quince" &amp; Destiny Myrick.</p>

    <h2>Full boilerplate</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a community art space opened in 2023 by Stow Dunham on Public Square in downtown Watertown, NY. Built by artists, for artists, the gallery is home to visual arts and exhibits, musical artists and events, literary arts professionals and workshops, sound healing, and more — a DIY hub where the North Country's creative community gathers, shows work, and plays shows.</p>
    <p>Phi Gallery also houses a collective of local makers and organizations, including WildRoots Wellness and Revival, Holdown Upstate, Local Legendz by Tunes 92.5, Faeried Treasure Trove, and a handful of incredible local artisanal vendors.</p>
    <p>The gallery is located at {{ settings.address.street }}, {{ settings.address.city }}, {{ settings.address.region }} {{ settings.address.postalCode }}, and is coordinated by Stow Dunham, Dana Gillan, and The Myricks (Mykel "Quince" Myrick &amp; Destiny Myrick).</p>

    <h2>Fact sheet</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Name</th><td>{{ settings.name }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>What</th><td>Community art gallery · live music venue · workshop space · vendor collective</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Founded</th><td>{{ settings.founded }}, by Stow Dunham</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Address</th><td>{{ settings.address.street }}, {{ settings.address.city }}, {{ settings.address.region }} {{ settings.address.postalCode }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Coordinators</th><td>Stow Dunham · Dana Gillan · Mykel "Quince" Myrick · Destiny Myrick</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Programs</th><td>Visual art exhibits · live music &amp; events · literary arts workshops · sound healing · local artisan market</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Residents</th><td>WildRoots Wellness and Revival · Holdown Upstate · Local Legendz by Tunes 92.5 · Faeried Treasure Trove</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Website</th><td>{{ site.url | replace('https://','') }}</td></tr>
      {% if settings.instagram %}<tr><th>Instagram</th><td>@{{ settings.instagram | replace('@','') }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
      <tr><th>Press contact</th><td><a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a></td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2>The people</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stow Dunham</strong> — Founder &amp; coordinator.</li>
      <li><strong>Dana Gillan</strong> — Coordinator.</li>
      <li><strong>Mykel "Quince" Myrick &amp; Destiny Myrick</strong> — Coordinators.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Usage</h2>
    <p>Photos and logos in this kit are approved for editorial use covering Phi Gallery. Please credit photographers as captioned. For interviews, high-res originals, or anything else, contact <a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a>.</p>
  </div>

  {%- if collections.pressSorted.length %}
  <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: var(--sp-6);"><h2>In the press</h2></div>
  <div>
    {%- for m in collections.pressSorted %}
    <article class="event-row" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;">
      <div class="event-row__body">
        <h3 class="event-row__title" style="font-size: var(--fs-base);">
          {% if m.data.url %}<a href="{{ m.data.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ m.data.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ m.data.title }}{% endif %}
        </h3>
        <p class="event-row__meta"><span>{{ m.data.outlet }}</span><span>{{ m.data.date | readableDate("LLL d, yyyy") }}</span></p>
      </div>
      {% if m.data.url %}<div class="event-row__cta"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" href="{{ m.data.url }}" rel="noopener">Read ↗</a></div>{% endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
